## Third-party data and software

This software uses the following third-party data and software:

- **Cell Ontology (CL 2024-06-10, CL 2024-08-15)** — distributed under
  CC-BY-3.0; retrieved from the OBO Foundry.
- **Tiktoken (OpenAI, 2024)** — MIT-licensed; used for the cl100k_base
  token-budget accounting in the renderer.
- **Pronto (Liu et al., 2019)** — BSD-licensed; used as the reference
  parser for the V0 lossless capsule serializer.
- **OWL 2 specification (Motik et al., 2009)** — W3C Recommendation;
  the OWL 2 RL reasoner is the verifier the renderer routes back to.

All third-party data and software are used in accordance with their
respective licenses; redistribution is at the user's responsibility.
